            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Pack Attack"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A red guard ant deals an additional 2d6 precision damage to any creature within reach of at least two of the ant's allies.\n\n**Red Ant Venom**\nDC: 36\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 4 rounds\n- Stage 1: 3d6 poison and enfeebled 1 (1 round)\n- Stage 2: 4d6 poison and enfeebled 2 (1 round)\n- Stage 3: 6d6 poison and enfeebled 3 (1 round)"
            },
